WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.444 --> 00:00:05.206
Brad: Something definitely happened that time!

2
00:00:05.827 --> 00:00:13.073
Danny: I told you I had a powerful imagination!

3
00:00:13.093 --> 00:00:43.138
Brad: Where where are Danny: Either we made things really, really big or Danny: Or we're really, really

4
00:00:43.238 --> 00:00:46.120
small! Brad: Wait a minute.

5
00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:48.041
We weren't supposed to shrink.

6
00:00:48.541 --> 00:00:50.802
Brad: The bullies were supposed to get big again.

7
00:00:50.822 --> 00:00:53.444
Danny: This is so cool!

8
00:01:00.984 --> 00:01:01.624
Danny: Hi, ant!

9
00:01:01.925 --> 00:01:03.225
You look pretty big now!

10
00:01:03.245 --> 00:01:06.887
Danny: Sorry if I squashed some of your friends yesterday!

11
00:01:06.907 --> 00:01:13.711
Ha-ha! Brad: Danny!

12
00:01:14.031 --> 00:01:14.832
Where did you go?

13
00:01:14.852 --> 00:01:16.393
Oh, great.

14
00:01:16.653 --> 00:01:21.175
Brad: I wonder where they're going.

15
00:01:22.216 --> 00:01:23.797
Danny! Danny!

16
00:01:24.457 --> 00:01:28.059
Danny! Danny: Whoa!

17
00:01:28.199 --> 00:01:28.880
What's that?

18
00:01:29.612 --> 00:01:32.094
Danny: He won't sting me because he can't see me.

19
00:01:33.275 --> 00:01:35.037
Being tiny is the best!

20
00:01:35.057 --> 00:01:38.840
Danny: Think of all the places I can get into now.

21
00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:44.184
Mr. Smith: That Danny can be a lot of trouble, but he's [n3@the best art student I've ever

22
00:01:44.244 --> 00:01:51.330
had. Danny: This is going to be a lot of fun.

23
00:01:51.350 --> 00:01:56.174
Mr. Smith: Ow!

24
00:01:56.595 --> 00:01:57.896
Do you see something in my eye?

25
00:01:58.676 --> 00:02:00.136
Mr. Smith: Is there a bug in my eye?

26
00:02:01.237 --> 00:02:02.537
Ow! Ow!

27
00:02:03.177 --> 00:02:05.978
Danny: Now I'll tickle his nose.

28
00:02:06.738 --> 00:02:08.359
Hee-hee! Mr.

29
00:02:09.259 --> 00:02:11.900
Smith: Ah ah ah-choo!

30
00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:14.620
Danny: Ha-ha-ha!

31
00:02:14.921 --> 00:02:19.722
I can't wait to try that.

32
00:02:28.532 --> 00:02:29.693
Brad: That's his laugh!

33
00:02:32.374 --> 00:02:33.294
Brad: Danny.

34
00:02:33.354 --> 00:02:34.555
Danny: Huh?

35
00:02:35.155 --> 00:02:35.835
Oh, it's you.

36
00:02:35.855 --> 00:02:38.916
Brad: You shouldn't run off like that.

37
00:02:38.936 --> 00:02:42.618
Danny: Brad, being small is the best!

38
00:02:43.398 --> 00:02:45.339
The possibilities are endless.

39
00:02:46.059 --> 00:02:47.080
Brad: Look out!

40
00:02:53.343 --> 00:02:54.123
Danny: Ugh!

41
00:02:54.763 --> 00:02:56.604
I'm covered in worm muck!

42
00:02:57.452 --> 00:02:58.473
Brad: Are you okay?

43
00:02:58.493 --> 00:03:00.895
Danny: Yes, I'm okay.

44
00:03:01.916 --> 00:03:04.098
Maybe being small isn't so great.

45
00:03:05.779 --> 00:03:09.042
Brad: You just have to watch out for the worms.

46
00:03:09.062 --> 00:03:11.544
Danny: That stupid shrink-gun.

47
00:03:11.564 --> 00:03:16.048
Danny: It was supposed to unshrink the bullies, not shrink us.

48
00:03:16.608 --> 00:03:22.213
Brad: Well, now that we're small, it should be easier to find them.

49
00:03:22.233 --> 00:03:25.176
Danny: I'm not sure that's a good idea, Brad.

50
00:03:25.792 --> 00:03:29.873
Danny: If we're as small as them, then they can beat us up again!

51
00:03:29.893 --> 00:03:32.694
Danny: I think you should make us big again.

52
00:03:32.714 --> 00:03:34.995
Brad: That's why we have to find them.

53
00:03:35.015 --> 00:03:37.375
Danny: What do you mean?

54
00:03:37.395 --> 00:03:40.756
Brad: Do you see the shrink-gun anywhere?

55
00:03:40.776 --> 00:03:41.956
Danny: No.

56
00:03:41.976 --> 00:03:45.857
Brad: Without it, I don't know how to make us big again.

57
00:03:45.877 --> 00:03:51.159
Danny: What does that have to do with finding those two bullies?

58
00:03:51.179 --> 00:03:55.080
Brad: If we find Chuck and Dave, I can examine them.

59
00:03:55.916 --> 00:04:00.038
Brad: A careful inspection will help me discover how to unshrink all of us.

60
00:04:00.058 --> 00:04:02.340
Danny: Well, let's start looking.

61
00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:09.503
Danny: Gross!

62
00:04:09.644 --> 00:04:10.604
What are those?

63
00:04:10.624 --> 00:04:12.245
Brad: Those are mites.

64
00:04:12.785 --> 00:04:14.326
They're excited about something.

65
00:04:15.187 --> 00:04:16.027
Let's go listen!

66
00:04:16.047 --> 00:04:19.889
Mite: The ants will pay us well for the humans!

67
00:04:20.069 --> 00:04:23.911
Ha-ha-ha! Danny Brad: They've got the bullies!
